# build artifact: dev.sh -b bundles the metasmith library in here for shipping.
# Generated, never edited; the source of truth is src/metasmith_libraries/.
src/fabfos/_library/

# Benchmark solve outputs and retrieved HPC results: multi-GB / 400 MB+ TSVs,
# reproducible from the recorded sockeye run key. The SCORE tables are small
# and ARE tracked.
transforms/build/benchmark/v3_build/run/
transforms/build/benchmark/v3_build/run_star_universe_baseline/

# /data is the project's DATA FOLDER, tracked via DVC: `data/<chunk>` holds the
# files and `data/<chunk>.dvc` is the pin that this repo commits. Do NOT ignore
# it -- DVC writes its own `data/.gitignore` per directory to keep the bulk out;
# only the pins (and small manifest dirs like `_metadata/`) are tracked.

# raw/LASER is an upstream git checkout (bitbucket.org/jdwinkler/laser_release),
# already pinned by url+sha256 in provenance/data/laser.yml -- not DVC-tracked,
# since hashing a tree of git repos as data bytes turns its .git into thousands
# of cache objects and the checkout stops being a checkout.
/data/raw/LASER/

# test artifacts: regenerable DAG renders from tests/*.py
tests/artifacts/
